  "_comment": "Pre-built reports, Home numbers and internal datasets. key = predefined_key (stable; the job selects its logic by key). id = the fixed report_master UUID (uuid5 of the key), so a CSV rebuild always recreates the same rows. kind: chart (listed under Pre-built, fits a Home panel), number (single value, fits a Home tile), dataset (internal, e.g. the Accounts screen; not listed). periods: presets the variant set covers (empty = the report has no period selector; default_period still anchors the computation). drills: published=aggregate means every drill value is precomputed; query_only means the drill opens list_transactions_view with a filter. sortable: tables re-ordered by the GAS reader without recomputing.",
